#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#In a parallel lateral force test (also called aiding or assisting), equal forces are applied in the Y direction of the sprung mass.
#
#The tire forces in CarSim are in the tire coordinates, so these are calculated to account for any toe or steer of the wheels.
#
#Output from the test begins with forces at the specified maximum value in the negative direction and runs through one complete cycle from negative to positive and back.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

